* 5\. The toxic reactions caused by previous anti-tumor treatment were relieved to grade 0-1 (according to NCI CTCAE version 5.0) or to an acceptable level of the inclusion/exclusion criteria. Except for other toxicities such as hair loss and vitiligo that researchers consider not to pose a safety risk to the subjects;
